<div class="y78">
<h3 class="y79">On your Mac</h3>
<p class="y80">Use an Apple silicon Mac with <a href="https://openclaw.ai" class="y16">OpenClaw</a> on the host. The app is free and lives in your menu bar.</p>
<div class="y12">
<a href="/beta" class="y81">Download for Mac</a>
<a href="/mac" class="y14">Alternative Mac download</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="y78">
