<p class="y80">Install Yorozu on your iPhone through TestFlight.</p>
<div class="y12">
<a href="/iphone" class="y82">Get for iPhone</a>
<a href="https://github.com/izyuumi/yorozu#development" class="y14">Development guide</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
